  "description": "Introducing the evolution of our celebrated Italia RC: a new, limited-edition, integrated race alloy frameset. Borrowing the carbon fork from our latest Leggero carbon frameset, the Italia RC is designed for riders who want to go fast on their bikes. Constructed from state-of-the-art 7000 series aluminium, and remodelled with a oversized 1.5\" headtube and integrated cabling. The seamless integration of the bike’s cables from hoods down to the frameset (integrated handlebars and stem required) shrinks the cockpit’s frontal area and reduces drag.",
